ocacy and engagement', 'Participate in debates and dialogues on poverty and global inequality.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG01_TER_011', 'Tertiary education', 'Advocacy and engagement', 'Collaborate with NGOs, research institutions, governments and development agencies on pro-poor initiatives.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG01_ADULT_001', 'Adult education', 'Empowerment and financial responsibility', 'Develop self-confidence and a sense of empowerment to participate actively in economic life and advocate for financial rights.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG01_ADULT_002', 'Adult education', 'Empowerment and financial responsibility', 'Encourage financial responsibility and resilience to support long-term income stability and economic independence.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG01_ADULT_003', 'Adult education', 'Equity and inclusion', 'Commit to economic inclusion by recognising the importance of equitable access to resources and opportunities for all.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG01_ADULT_004', 'Adult education', 'Equity and inclusion', 'Embrace solidarity and shared responsibility, understanding that poverty reduction depends on collective action and support networks.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG01_ADULT_005', 'Adult education', 'Collaboration and civic participation', 'Engage in community participation and collaborative economic decision-making that promotes inclusive development.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG01_ADULT_006', 'Adult education', 'Collaboration and civic participation', 'Value co-operation and mutual support in addressing local and global economic challenges.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG01_ADULT_007', 'Adult education', 'Proactive and lifelong learning mindset', 'Cultivate an initiative-taking, solution-oriented mindset that embraces lifelong learning to navigate and overcome economic challenges.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG02_SEC_001', 'Secondary education', 'Empathy and global citizenship', 'Show empathy and solidarity with individuals and communities affected by hunger and malnutrition.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG02_S